SUMMARY:🌈🎤 TITANIUM: STRONG TOGETHER — A PRIDE CONCERT WITH TEMPO 
 CHORUS 🎤🌈
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🌈
 🎤 TITANIUM: STRONG TOGETHER — A PRIDE CONCERT WITH TEMPO CHORUS 🎤
 🌈\n\nTwo nights of epic Pride anthems\, powerful vocals\, and unapologe
 tic queer joy at Hugh's Room Live.\n\nI’ll once again be performing with
  Tempo Chorus in our brand-new Pride concert: **Titanium: Strong Together*
 * — happening June 9 & 10!\n\nTEMPO is one of Toronto’s boldest\, funn
 iest\, and most entertaining queer choirs — blending pop music\, musical
  theatre\, powerhouse vocals\, camp\, heart\, and unexpected twists into a
  show that feels more like a full experience than a traditional concert. 
 🎭✨\n\nThink:\n🎤 Contemporary hits\n🌈 Pride energy\n🔥 Big emo
 tions\n😂 A little chaos\n💎 And a whole lot of heart\n\nThis is not a
  quiet sit-politely kind of choir concert.\nIt’s vibrant. Emotional. Fun
 ny. Joyful.\n\nAnd honestly? A really beautiful room to be in right now.\n
 If you love music\, community\, and nights that leave you feeling lifted u
 p — this is the show. 💫\n\n***\n\n🎄 **Meetup Time:** 7:15pm\n🎅 
 **Doors Open:** 7:30pm\n✨ **Show Starts:** 8:00pm\n⏱️ **Run Time:** 
 90 minutes\n🎟️ **Cost:** $28.25 — **Don’t wait! TEMPO shows have 
 been SELLING OUT!**\n📍 **Venue:** Hugh’s Room\n🎫 **Tickets:** *[Cl
 ick Here!](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/titanium-strong-together-tickets-19
 88709552807?utm_experiment=test_share_listing&aff=ebdsshios&sg=1ecdf72a899
 7081135754a34298e7b71731376962644257c83aabdc11a48d799f84b25533bd4dc4ba309d
 21263e97388418eb47b3b81dba57eea00bbe733432bfc1eab04585bb785a188f0c16b)*\n
 📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsa
 pp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n**Meetup Fee:** None! All proceeds go di
 rectly to supporting TEMPO’s amazing work. ❤️\n\n**Meetup Spot:** Mo
 re details coming soon!\n**Intermission:** Yes!\n\n📅 Can’t make this 
 show? There’s another one the following day — but this is the night ou
 r Meetup Group is attending together.\n🍻 **No outing after the show** 
 — we’ll keep the magic in the moment.\n\n***\n\n🎄 **PLEASE NOTE:**\
 n• Tickets **must be purchased before signing up**.\n• Seats **cannot*
 * be saved for late arrivals.\n• You can still sign up or show up on the
  day of if you're unsure — just grab your ticket first! 🎟️✨\n\n**
 *\n\n💛 **This group is for everyone** — single\, not single\, social 
 butterflies or shy newcomers.\n\nWe host **movies\, walks\, hikes\, arts &
  culture outings\, restaurants\, and more**.\n\nIt’s all about *communit
 y\, connection\, and shared experiences.* 🌟\nI can’t wait to see you 
 there — let’s make this holiday season sparkle together! 🎄✨🎶\n
 \nIf you need to reach me\, message me on the event wall or email: **toron
 tomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**
